### receiver eth2.82 sends IGMPv3 CHANGE_TO_INCLUDE {10.10.81.20} for 239.100.0.10 ###

u4# show ip igmp groups 239.100.0.10 detail
Interface:      vlan82
Group:          239.100.0.10
Group mode:     Include ()                       <-- INCLUDE mode = SSM (not EXCLUDE/ASM)
Last reporter:  10.10.82.20
Include Source List :
  Source Address  Uptime    v3 Exp    Fwd  Flags
  10.10.81.20     00:00:17  stopped   Yes         <-- source-specific: forwards only S
  => the group in the user-defined range is treated as SSM: the receiver joined a
     specific (S,G) and the router holds an INCLUDE source list, not a (*,G).

